{"seq":3,"slug":"classification-regression","title":"分类与回归共形","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/conformal-prediction-uncertainty/advanced/classification-regression","wordCount":1352,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"分类与回归共形\">分类与回归共形</h1><p>CP 的覆盖保证对任务一视同仁，但&quot;预测集&quot;在两类任务里长得完全不同：回归输出一个连续<strong>区间</strong>，分类输出一个离散<strong>标签集</strong>。评分怎么设、集合怎么构造、好坏怎么评价，两条线各有讲究。本篇把回归共形与分类共形并排讲透，作为方法章评分设计与进阶章自适应方法在两类任务上的落地汇总。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>两类任务的 CP 共享同一个骨架（校准集算分数、取分位阈值、构造集合），分歧在于输出空间。回归的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span></span></span></span> 连续，预测集是实轴上的区间；分类的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span></span></span></span> 离散，预测集是标签的子集。这个分歧决定了评分、集合构造、评价指标三处全都要分别设计。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[共形骨架&lt;br/&gt;校准取分位] --&gt; B{输出空间?}&#10;  B --&gt;|连续| C[回归共形]&#10;  B --&gt;|离散| D[分类共形]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[评分: 残差/CQR]&#10;  C --&gt; C2[集合: 区间 l,u]&#10;  C --&gt; C3[评价: 覆盖率 + 平均宽度]&#10;  D --&gt; D1[评分: 1减概率/APS]&#10;  D --&gt; D2[集合: 标签子集]&#10;  D --&gt; D3[评价: 覆盖率 + 平均集合大小]\">flowchart TD\n  A[共形骨架&lt;br/&gt;校准取分位] --&gt; B{输出空间?}\n  B --&gt;|连续| C[回归共形]\n  B --&gt;|离散| D[分类共形]\n  C --&gt; C1[评分: 残差/CQR]\n  C --&gt; C2[集合: 区间 l,u]\n  C --&gt; C3[评价: 覆盖率 + 平均宽度]\n  D --&gt; D1[评分: 1减概率/APS]\n  D --&gt; D2[集合: 标签子集]\n  D --&gt; D3[评价: 覆盖率 + 平均集合大小]</pre><h2 id=\"回归共形-区间与宽度的博弈\">回归共形：区间与宽度的博弈</h2><p>回归 CP 的预测集是区间，核心张力在&quot;覆盖率&quot;与&quot;区间宽度&quot;之间——窄区间更有用但易欠覆盖，宽区间安全但无信息。评分的演进（绝对残差 → 归一化残差 → CQR）本质就是在固定覆盖下不断压窄区间、并让宽度贴合局部不确定性，完整谱系见 <a href=\"../methods/nonconformity-scores\">不符合度评分</a>。这里强调评价：回归 CP 必须<strong>同时</strong>报告两个数——经验覆盖率（应接近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>）与平均区间宽度（越小越好）。只看覆盖率会被&quot;无限宽区间&quot;骗过，只看宽度会被&quot;窄但欠覆盖&quot;骗过。一个好系统是在覆盖达标前提下宽度最小。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分类共形-标签集与集合大小\">分类共形：标签集与集合大小</h2><p>分类 CP 的预测集是标签子集，对应的张力是&quot;覆盖率&quot;与&quot;集合大小&quot;。评分从朴素的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 - \\hat{p}(y\\mid x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 到自适应的累积质量评分，后者发展为 <a href=\"adaptive-prediction-sets\">自适应预测集 (APS)</a>，让集合在困难样本上变大、避免欠覆盖。评价同样是两个数：经验覆盖率与平均集合大小（越小越好，理想下简单样本接近单标签）。一个额外的实用指标是&quot;奇异度&quot;（singleton 率）——多少比例样本的集合恰好只含一个标签，它衡量系统在简单情形下的果断程度。下表把两类任务的对应关系并列。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>回归共形</th>\n<th>分类共形</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>预测集形态</td>\n<td>实轴区间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>l</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>u</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[\\hat{l}, \\hat{u}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2079em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>标签子集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{k_1, k_2, \\dots\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基础评分</td>\n<td>绝对残差</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 - \\hat{p}(y\\mid x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自适应评分</td>\n<td>归一化残差 / CQR</td>\n<td>累积质量 / APS / RAPS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主评价指标</td>\n<td>平均区间宽度</td>\n<td>平均集合大小、奇异度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>副指标</td>\n<td>区间是否非对称合理</td>\n<td>空集率（应极低）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>共同硬指标</td>\n<td>经验覆盖率 ≈ <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>经验覆盖率 ≈ <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"两个任务特有的陷阱\">两个任务特有的陷阱</h2><p>回归共形特有的陷阱是<strong>异方差</strong>：误差尺度随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 变化时，等宽区间会在高噪声区欠覆盖、低噪声区浪费，必须上归一化残差或 CQR。分类共形特有的陷阱有二：一是<strong>空集</strong>——当某样本所有标签的概率都太低、无一进入阈值时集合可能为空，这在语义上等于&quot;我无法给出任何有保证的预测&quot;，需特殊处理（如强制纳入最高概率标签，但要意识到这会破坏严格保证）；二是<strong>类别不平衡</strong>，罕见类的覆盖容易被多数类淹没，往往需结合 <a href=\"conditional-coverage\">条件覆盖</a> 的类条件（Mondrian）方法分别校准。这些陷阱说明：选回归还是分类 CP，不只看输出类型，还要看数据的噪声结构与类别分布。</p>\n<h2 id=\"选型决策-不止看输出类型\">选型决策：不止看输出类型</h2><p>一个常被忽略的点：同一个业务问题，回归与分类的 CP 选择可以互换，而互换会改变不确定性的表达方式。例如&quot;预测用户下单金额&quot;既可做回归 CP（输出金额区间），也可离散化成档位做分类 CP（输出档位集合）。前者保留连续信息但区间可能宽得难用，后者牺牲精度换来更直观的&quot;几个候选档位&quot;。决策依据是下游如何消费不确定性：需要精确数值边界选回归，需要离散决策候选选分类。这种选型自由，正是 CP &quot;模型无关、任务骨架统一&quot;带来的灵活性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>两类任务共享共形骨架，分歧在输出空间：回归输出区间，分类输出标签集，评分/构造/评价三处分别设计。</li>\n<li>回归核心张力是覆盖率 vs 区间宽度，必须同时报告两者；评分演进即在固定覆盖下压窄区间。</li>\n<li>分类核心张力是覆盖率 vs 集合大小，附加奇异度、空集率指标；自适应评分（APS）避免困难样本欠覆盖。</li>\n<li>特有陷阱：回归的异方差（用 CQR）、分类的空集与类别不平衡（用 Mondrian 类条件）。</li>\n<li>同一问题回归/分类 CP 可互换，依下游如何消费不确定性决定，是 CP 任务无关性的灵活体现。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>两类任务评分的完整谱系：<a href=\"../methods/nonconformity-scores\">不符合度评分</a></li>\n<li>分类自适应评分的深入：<a href=\"adaptive-prediction-sets\">自适应预测集 (APS)</a></li>\n<li>类别不平衡下的分组校准：<a href=\"conditional-coverage\">条件覆盖</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分类与回归共形","id":"分类与回归共形"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"回归共形：区间与宽度的博弈","id":"回归共形-区间与宽度的博弈"},{"level":2,"text":"分类共形：标签集与集合大小","id":"分类共形-标签集与集合大小"},{"level":2,"text":"两个任务特有的陷阱","id":"两个任务特有的陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"选型决策：不止看输出类型","id":"选型决策-不止看输出类型"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"条件覆盖","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/conformal-prediction-uncertainty/advanced/conditional-coverage"},"next":{"title":"分布漂移与加权","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/conformal-prediction-uncertainty/practice/distribution-shift"}}